---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of use — jerseycbt"
  description="Terms for using jerseycbt.com — what the site is and isn't, fees and cancellations, and what to do if you're in crisis.">
  <Nav />
  <main id="main-content" tabindex="-1" class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 content-prose">
    <h1>Terms of use</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-subtle-text">Last reviewed: May 2026</p>

    <h2>About this site</h2>
    <p>This website belongs to Rodrigo Silva (jerseycbt), a psychotherapist based in St Helier, Jersey. It's here to explain how I work, and to let you get in touch or book a consultation.</p>

    <h2>Not advice — and not an emergency service</h2>
    <p>The information here is general and isn't a substitute for individual professional advice or assessment. Nothing on this site, and nothing said in a free 15-minute call, is clinical treatment.</p>
    <p><strong>If you are in crisis or at risk of harm, please don't use this website to get help.</strong> Contact your GP, call 999, attend your nearest emergency department, or call the Samaritans free on 116 123, any time of day or night.</p>

    <h2>Booking, fees, and cancellations</h2>
    <p>Sessions are £100 for 50 minutes; the free 15-minute consultation is a fit call, not a session. Submitting the form or booking a call is a request — an appointment is confirmed once I reply to arrange it. I ask for at least 48 hours' notice to move or cancel a session; sessions cancelled with less notice may be charged.</p>

    <h2>Using the website</h2>
    <p>You may use this site for your own personal, non-commercial purposes. It links to external organisations (such as the NHS, Mind, BABCP, ACAT and NICE) for your convenience; I'm not responsible for the content of other websites.</p>

    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>The text and design of this site are © Rodrigo Silva unless stated otherwise, and may not be reproduced without permission.</p>

    <h2>Liability</h2>
    <p>I take care to keep the site accurate and available, but I can't guarantee it will always be error-free or uninterrupted, and I'm not liable for any loss arising from relying on the general information here. Nothing in these terms limits any liability that cannot lawfully be limited.</p>

    <h2>Governing law</h2>
    <p>These terms are governed by the law of Jersey.</p>

    <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
    <p>I may update these terms from time to time; the current version always lives on this page. Questions: <a href="mailto:hello@jerseycbt.com">hello@jerseycbt.com</a>.</p>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
